LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# NPT equilibration of bulk fcc Al at 300 K, 1 atm
# EAM potential: Ercolessi & Adams (1994), OpenKIM v002

units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p

# fcc Al lattice (a0 = 4.032 Å, from potential header)
lattice         fcc 4.032
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 4.032 4.032 4.032
region          box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.16 20.16 20.16)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 500 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.16 20.16 20.16)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

mass            1 26.982

# EAM (Ercolessi & Adams) for Al
pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * Al.eam.alloy Al

# Initial velocities at 2x target T (gets halved by equipartition)
velocity        all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

# Output
thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol

# 1 fs timestep -> 500000 steps = 500 ps
timestep        0.001

# NPT: 300 K, 1 atm, taut = 0.1 ps, taup = 1.0 ps
fix             1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.0 1.0 1.0

run 10
